# Pauper explorer. The other half of the Pauper pair: pike attacks the leader,
# wren looks for a deck nobody has built. Partitioned off pike by card id and
# by theme so the two never rank the same archetypes.
#
# A low floor on purpose. The incumbent here will be strong early (19.0W of 22
# from a cold archetype), and a floor measured against it would reject every
# new idea for being worse than a deck that is already losing to AD&D.
ABAGENT_ARENA=pauper
ABAGENT_FLAGS=--refine-gens 6 --refine-budget 240 --seed-mod 2 --seed-rem 1 --theme-mod 2 --theme-rem 1 --slice 40 --floor-frac 0.60 --theme-tags poison,amplify-poison,dishonor,lose-honor,sacrifice,mill,exile,curse,demon,horror,undead,skeleton,zombie,vampire,reanimate,void,discard,drawback,piercing,destroy
